 making her a pioneer recognized across history. Her story highlights how acknowledging a single trailblazer can inspire generations, proving that one example of recognition can carry influence far beyond its own era.</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":null},"settings":{"canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"fibDataType":"string","hasCorrectAnswer":true}},"createdAt":"2025-11-10T18:23:44.611Z","updated":"2025-11-11T08:03:39.476Z","cloned":true,"ver":2,"time":30000,"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"state":"inactive","attempt":0},"69122e3626584347adca6825":{"_id":"69122e3626584347adca6825","type":"MCQ","structure":{"explain":{},"hasMath":false,"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0},"options":[{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Gender obscured achievement</strong></p><p></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Acknowledging achievement of a pioneer</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Attempting to create a gender balance</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Uniformity is not always beneficial</strong></p><p></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Men unfairly advantaged/ credited</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"}],"query":{"answerTime":-1,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>TOPIC: GENDER EQUALITY ver chính</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;C. For centuries, men benefited from structures that ensured their dominance. Universities barred women from study, societies refused their membership, and when collaborative research appeared, male names were usually placed first. Even mediocre male mathematicians could rise quickly, while women of extraordinary ability were slowed or excluded. This unfair credit system distorted perceptions of talent, making it seem as though mathematics belonged to men alone. In reality, many women’s efforts were hidden behind the inflated reputations of their male peers.</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":null},"settings":{"canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"fibDataType":"string","hasCorrectAnswer":true}},"createdAt":"2025-11-10T18:25:58.033Z","updated":"2025-11-11T08:03:39.476Z","cloned":true,"ver":2,"time":30000,"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"state":"inactive","attempt":0},"69122eae42e0cf67cdb47994":{"_id":"69122eae42e0cf67cdb47994","type":"MCQ","structure":{"explain":{},"hasMath":false,"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0},"options":[{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Acknowledging achievement of a pioneer</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Uniformity is not always beneficial</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Attempting to create a gender balance</strong></p><p></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>A long career showing exceptional ability</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Labels can change perspective on people</strong></p><p></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"}],"query":{"answerTime":-1,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>TOPIC: GENDER EQUALITY VER CHÍNH </strong></p><p><strong>D. &nbsp;Some women, despite obstacles, managed to sustain careers of remarkable depth. Emmy Noether, for instance, transformed abstract algebra and theoretical physics, influencing entire fields through her ideas. Her journey was not straightforward—she faced years of rejection and only temporary appointments—but her intellectual power ensured that her work could not be ignored forever. A long career of exceptional brilliance showed that women were not occasional contributors but central figures whose ideas shaped mathematics as profoundly as those of their male counterparts.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","type":null},"settings":{"canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"fibDataType":"string","hasCorrectAnswer":true}},"createdAt":"2025-11-10T18:27:58.196Z","updated":"2025-11-11T08:03:39.476Z","cloned":true,"ver":2,"time":30000,"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"state":"inactive","attempt":0},"69122f200a4b4af3fbda16bb":{"_id":"69122f200a4b4af3fbda16bb","type":"MCQ","structure":{"explain":{},"hasMath":false,"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0},"options":[{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Attempting to create a gender balance</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Gender obscured achievement</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Success of women in the field of Mathematics</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Labels can change perspective on people</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Uniformity is not always beneficial</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"}],"query":{"answerTime":-1,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>TOPIC: GENDER EQUALITY VER CHÍNH</strong></p><p>E. <strong>&nbsp;The way society labels individuals often defines how their abilities are perceived. For a long time, women were cast as “unsuited” for rigorous subjects, while men were labeled “natural” mathematicians. These labels shaped expectations, narrowing opportunities for one group while elevating the other. Over time, however, shifting perspectives revealed the weakness of such assumptions. As women demonstrated skill equal to men, labels began to change. What was once seen as a fixed truth proved to be nothing more than a cultural invention waiting to be dismantled.</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":null},"settings":{"canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"fibDataType":"string","hasCorrectAnswer":true}},"createdAt":"2025-11-10T18:29:52.913Z","updated":"2025-11-11T08:03:39.476Z","cloned":true,"ver":2,"time":30000,"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"state":"inactive","attempt":0},"69122f90e3f11131f4428f1b":{"_id":"69122f90e3f11131f4428f1b","type":"MCQ","structure":{"explain":{},"hasMath":false,"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0},"options":[{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>A long career showing exceptional ability</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Gender obscured achievement</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Attempting to create a gender balance</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Men unfairly advantaged</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Uniformity is not always beneficial</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"}],"query":{"answerTime":-1,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>TOPIC: GENDER EQUALITY VER CHÍNH</strong></p><p><strong>F. &nbsp;In recent decades, initiatives have sought to close the gender gap in mathematics. Scholarships, mentorship programs, and policies encouraging female representation have all contributed to gradual progress. Universities now highlight role models and provide supportive environments for women pursuing advanced study. Although disparities remain, attempts to create gender balance have redefined what is possible. The aim is not charity but fairness: ensuring that talent, wherever it is found, can thrive without being silenced by outdated expectations.</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":null},"settings":{"canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"fibDataType":"string","hasCorrectAnswer":true}},"createdAt":"2025-11-10T18:31:44.214Z","updated":"2025-11-11T08:03:39.476Z","cloned":true,"ver":2,"time":30000,"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"state":"inactive","attempt":0},"691230023cce0defcaaf8033":{"_id":"691230023cce0defcaaf8033","type":"MCQ","structure":{"explain":{},"hasMath":false,"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0},"options":[{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b598","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Attempting equality</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b599","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Uniformity is not always beneficial</strong></p><p></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59a","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Success of women in the field of Mathematics</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83930207a51a0bbb2b59b","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>Men unfairly advantaged</strong></p>","type":"text"},{"_id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","answerTime":0,"hasMath":false,"id":"68c83b26207a51a0bbb2b5b0","math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>A long career showing exceptional ability</strong></p><p><br></p>","type":"text"}],"query":{"answerTime":-1,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"media":[],"text":"<p><strong>TOPIC: GENDER EQUALITY</strong></p><p>G. <strong>While striving for equality, it is also important to recognize that identical treatment does not always resul